{
  "name": "ishizue-site",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite --port=3000 --host=0.0.0.0",
"generate:articles": "tsx scripts/generateArticles.ts",
"build": "npm run generate:articles && npm run generate:sitemap && vite build"
```

**③ `src/data/articles.ts` の先頭にコメントを追加（任意）**

次回ビルド後に自動上書きされるので、今の内容は保持されます。

---

## 動作の仕組み
```
npm run build
  └─ generate:articles    ← 記事ファイルを解析して articles.ts を上書き生成
  └─ generate:sitemap     ← 生成済みの articles.ts を読んで sitemap.xml を生成
  └─ vite build           ← 生成済みの articles.ts を使ってビルド
    "generate:sitemap": "tsx scripts/generateSitemap.ts",
    "preview": "vite preview",
    "clean": "rm -rf dist",
    "lint": "tsc --noEmit"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@emailjs/browser": "^4.4.1",
    "@google/genai": "^1.29.0",
    "better-sqlite3": "^12.4.1",
    "dotenv": "^17.2.3",
    "express": "^4.21.2",
    "lucide-react": "^0.546.0",
    "motion": "^12.23.24",
    "react": "^18.2.0",
    "react-dom": "^18.2.0",
    "react-router-dom": "^6.14.1",
    "react-helmet-async": "^2.0.4"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/express": "^4.17.21",
    "@types/node": "^22.14.0",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^5.0.4",
    "autoprefixer": "^10.4.21",
    "tailwindcss": "^3.4.4",
    "tsx": "^4.21.0",
    "typescript": "~5.8.2",
    "vite": "^6.2.0"
  }
}
